Placeholder so the assets/ directory exists.
Expo Metro scans this folder for app icons and splash screens.
For development we don't need any actual assets here — Expo uses defaults.
Before shipping to TestFlight / Play Store, add:
  - icon.png         (1024x1024)
  - splash.png       (varies, see Expo docs)
  - adaptive-icon.png (Android, 1024x1024)
  - favicon.png      (web, 48x48)
